      "id": "claim_7f4916f472fc45d886af493824967638",
      "statement": "BackupService creates backup archives named backup-<YYYYMMDD>-<HHmmss>.tar.gz (enforced by the regex /^backup-\\d{8}-\\d{6}\\.tar\\.gz$/) containing exactly three entries — manifest.json, a consistent SQLite snapshot djimitflo.sqlite produced via better-sqlite3's online backup API, and checksums.sha256 — and additionally writes a plaintext sidecar <filename>.manifest.json next to the archive for listing without untarring.",
