      "id": "claim_2c4e69825f4e41fd8045f728af00e8c6",
      "statement": "The backup HTTP surface (createBackupRoutes) is mounted under /api/backups (createRoutes is mounted at /api and mounts createBackupRoutes at /backups with requireAuth) and every endpoint additionally requires the manage:backups permission, exposing POST / (create, 201), GET / (list), GET /:filename (metadata, 404), GET /:filename/download (streams application/gzip), POST /:filename/validate, and POST /:filename/restore (maps confirmation/validation/invalid-name errors to 400, not-found to 404).",
